  "prefLabel": "Mid 201.01 Applicability of Plc 200",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mid 201.01 Applicability of Plc 200. The Plc 200 rules shall govern the midwifery council with regards to all procedures for:\n\n(a) The receipt and investigation of misconduct complaints;\n\n(b) The conduct of adjudicative and non-adjudicative proceedings;\n\n(c) Rulemaking submissions, considerations, and dispositions of rulemaking petitions;\n\n(d) Public comment hearings;\n\n(e) Declaratory rulings;\n\n(f) Explanation of adopted rules;\n\n(g) Voluntary surrender of licenses; and\n\n(h) Waivers.\n\nSource. #14492, eff 2-8-26\n\nAPPENDIX\n\nRULE | STATUTE\n\nMid 201 | RSA 541-A:16, I(b)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/mid200.html"
